  "interfaces": {
    "input": "Natural A2m parent with transitive maximal omission on m pairs and alternating block image, m>=8; exact smaller-degree alternating induction12<=q<2m plus accepted finite maxima.",
    "actual_faithfulness": "The endpoint subgroup T cannot contain z because the omitted mark centralizes T but not z. Its pair-kernel is therefore trivial and its projection has genuine full IP.",
    "intransitive_image": "Rank m-3 in Am forces exactly two orbits and full symmetric projections. For larger orbit>=5 this is the parity fibre product. Pure normal-factor fixed sets separate the doubled orbits. The3+odd case is excluded by an extremal symmetric projection and its odd-order kernel;2+even is excluded by parity.",
    "four_plus_four": "Both subdirect kernels are V4 or A4. Equivariance and the absence of a2-dimensional invariant subspace of the four-point binary module make either kernel fix the opposite doubled orbit. Fixed sets then allow the actual pair-centralizer lemma on each side.",
    "degree_eight_transitive": "The accepted unique even degree8 rank5 group has order576 and literal two4-block partition {1,2,3,8}|{4,5,6,7}. A faithful double cover has point stabilizer the unique index2 subgroup A3xA4 of (S3xS4)^+, with normalizer equal to the block stabilizer.",
    "closure": "Complete acquired proofs and required finite executions remain dependencies. No old census is rerun. The diagnostic search for the displayed4-block partition is not required: direct generator containment and accepted order prove the identification in the manuscript.",
    "no_hidden_splitting": "No splitting of B as C2xAm and no action of a block-breaking dihedral group on the original pairs is assumed."
  },
  "contributions": "The source supplies the invariant-module route; author supplies faithful endpoint projection, exact intransitive parity-product analysis and double-cover centralizers including degree8. Root received candidate progress notes but supplied no proof step or correction to this packet before freezing. Distinct reviewer supplied no new argument.",
  "edition_correction": "v2 corrects two literal qquad separators in displayed equation (3). Mathematical statements and proof prose are unchanged. v1 remains immutable.",
